b.com/kadubhumika","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T20:56:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T20:56:01Z","body":"Hi! @zach-overflow  I’ve investigated #73661 and prototyped the async Python client generation locally.\n\nI was able to verify that the newer generator configuration can produce both:\n\n* the existing synchronous methods, e.g. `get_version()`\n* new async methods, e.g. `get_version_async()`\nI also tested the generated client imports successfully and verified that the generated package uses the `httpx2` transport.\n\nThe current blocker is the OpenAPI Generator version: Airflow is pinned to 7.25.0, while the 7.26.0 line is currently still a SNAPSHOT. I don’t want to introduce an unreleased generator version into Airflow just to make the prototype work.\nI’ve therefore paused the implementation before opening a PR. Once the required generator support is available as a stable release, I can continue with the Breeze generation changes, templates, and tests.\n\nCould you let me know if this is the expected direction for #73661, or if you would prefer a different approach that works with the currently pinned generator?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5839490555/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kadubhumika","id":184811517,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwP__Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184811517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika","html_url":"https://github.com/kadubhumika","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadubhumika/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":31864847662,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAgUK288AAAABS-QKcc8AAAAHa0r9Lg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/31864847662","actor":{"login":"zach-overflow","id":4951117,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTExMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4951117?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow","html_url":"https://github.com/zach-overflow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow