ch I don't think is a good situation. \n\nThere's also a bit of post-processing required to ensure both the async and sync generated clients operate on the same pydantic models since`openapi-generator-cli` will try to create duplicate models. This point isn't a huge deal, but worth flagging as well.\n\nI'll update the ticket description to highlight this comment for now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5890350089/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zach-overflow","id":4951117,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTExMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4951117?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow","html_url":"https://github.com/zach-overflow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zach-overflow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":32078857994,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAgUK288AAAABS-QKcc8AAAAHeAyHCg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/32078857994","actor":{"login":"kadubhumika","id":184811517,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwP__Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184811517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"h